        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How do I calculate my body proportions?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Divide one measurement by another. Waist-to-hip ratio is waist ÷ hips, waist-to-height ratio is waist ÷ height, leg-length ratio is inseam ÷ height, and heads tall is height ÷ head height. Enter your numbers in the calculator above and it does the division and adds a reference range for each ratio."
