            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Divide your height by your head height, measured from chin to crown. Many adults land between about 7 and 7.5 heads; artists often draw realistic figures at 7.5 heads and idealized figures at 8. Enter your height and head height in the optional fields to see your number."
